&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Castrol is one of the world’s leading lubricant brands, serving customers and consumers in the automotive, marine, industrial and energy sectors. Castrol brands are recognised globally for their premium quality and high performance, shaped by the company’s commitment to innovation and cutting-edge technology. With products sold in more than 150 countries, Castrol has helped keep things moving on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt; roads &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;and racetracks, air, sea, and space for over 125 years.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;Whether you&#39;re just starting out or ready for your next big move, you&#39;re in the right place to explore an exciting career with Castrol.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(65, 145, 76);&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;Job description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About the team&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;As part of the Accounting, Reporting &amp;amp; Control team, you will support the delivery of financial accounting and reporting activities for the Castrol UK business, as well as support for global technology, marketing and supply chain function areas. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;You will work closely with colleagues across finance and the wider business to ensure timely, accurate and compliant financial reporting while contributing to continuous improvement initiatives. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;This is a mid-level role that would suit someone with a solid accounting foundation who enjoys analysing financial information, solving problems and working within a collaborative international environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Key Tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Financial accounting &amp;amp; reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support monthly, quarterly and annual financial close activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Prepare and review financial reporting in accordance with IFRS and group reporting requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure accurate accounting entries and compliance with internal policies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support balance sheet assurance processes and reconciliations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Maintain accuracy of intercompany accounting and reporting activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support other group reporting requirements and requests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Controls, compliance &amp;amp; risk management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ensure adherence to accounting policies and regulatory requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Process improvement &amp;amp; analysis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Analyse financial data to identify trends and improvement opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support automation and digitalisation initiatives across accounting processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with finance and business stakeholders across the UK and global functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Experience Required&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Finance, Accounting or a related discipline - or equivalent relevant professional experience (At least 2 years of relevant accounting or finance experience)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Practical exposure to IFRS accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding of financial reporting processes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving capability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent written and spoken English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(65, 145, 76);&quot;&gt;Privacy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;The Castrol entity recruiting for this role is the data controller for the personal information you provide. We use it to assess your application and to manage the recruitment and onboarding process. We may share it with service providers who support our recruitment, and it may be transferred to other Castrol entities internationally under appropriate safeguards. We keep it only for as long as necessary. For details of how we use your information and your data protection rights, contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a id=&quot;OWAcac3778b-aec2-4e71-7765-87f7daa1b8b6&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot; href=&quot;mailto:privacy.response@castrol.com&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;privacy.response@castrol.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, socioeconomic status, neurodiversity/neurocognitive functioning, veteran status or disability status. Individuals with an accessibility need may request an adjustment/accommodation related to Castrol recruiting process (e.g., accessing the job application, completing required assessments, participating in telephone screenings or interviews, etc.).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are selected for a position and depending upon your role, your employment may be contingent upon adherence to local policy. This may include pre-placement drug screening, medical review of physical fitness for the role, and background checks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Castrol is one of the world’s leading lubricant brands, serving customers and consumers in the automotive, marine, industrial and energy sectors. Castrol brands are recognised globally for their premium quality and high performance, shaped by the company’s commitment to innovation and cutting-edge technology. With products sold in more than 150 countries, Castrol has helped keep things moving on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt; roads &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;and racetracks, air, sea, and space for over 125 years.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;Whether you&#39;re just starting out or ready for your next big move, you&#39;re in the right place to explore an exciting career with Castrol.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(65, 145, 76);&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;Job description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Plant Coordinator – 3P Q&amp;amp;C provides end-to-end operational, process, and data support for SKU BOM creation, maintenance, and change management across third-party (3P) manufacturing sites. The role ensures SKU BOMs are accurately created, maintained, and implemented through Fusion and the Fusion 3P External Portal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the execution backbone for BOM management and change control, the role ensures data integrity, process discipline, full traceability, and audit readiness. Working closely with the 3P Q&amp;amp;C Advisor and 3P Planning teams, the position supports seamless coordination across data setup, change implementation, and supplier execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success is measured by BOM accuracy, on-time implementation, reliable change execution, data quality, and audit readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Key tasks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; SKU BOM Creation &amp;amp; Master Data Management (Packaging Scope Only)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOM Creation &amp;amp; Setup&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain SKU BOMs for packed products, including packaging components (labels, bottles, caps, drums, cartons, etc.) and finished SKU assembly structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure BOMs are complete, accurate, executable by 3P plants, and released only after confirming no missing components and clear packaging configurations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Validation &amp;amp; Readiness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify alignment between Production BOMs and Sales BOMs, component materials and finished SKUs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate units of measure, item categories, sales organization assignments, and identify technical inconsistencies such as deletion flags or missing links.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure BOMs are complete, accurate, interpretable by suppliers, and ready for operational execution before release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;SKU BOM Change Management &amp;amp; Control (Non-Formulation)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and update BOMs for label changes, packaging component changes, and structural adjustments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document change rationale, implementation timelines, and packaging material impacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Controlled Execution &amp;amp; Impact Assessment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage BOM changes through Fusion and Fusion 3P Portal, including submission, tracking, and supplier acknowledgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure controlled release, full traceability, and prevent unauthorized implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess impact on packaging materials, stock, finished goods, and ongoing production, supporting phase-in/phase-out strategies and mitigation actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fusion 3P Portal &amp;amp; Data Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portal Administration &amp;amp; Supplier Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain SKU BOM data across Fusion, Fusion 3P Portal, SAP/local systems, and supplier setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use the Fusion 3P Portal as the primary channel for BOM sharing and change communication, ensuring complete, structured, and accurate information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Quality &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve data errors, missing information, and BOM inconsistencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support testing activities and provide feedback to Fusion system owners to enhance processes and system performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Follow-Up – SKU/BOM Related Changes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Coordination &amp;amp; Monitoring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track projects involving new SKU setups, packaging changes, label changes, and BOM updates, monitoring timelines, milestones, implementation readiness, and risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with 3P Q&amp;amp;C Advisors, Planning, Procurement, and 3P suppliers to ensure BOM readiness, implementation timing, supplier execution, and production readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate issues relating to delays, data inconsistencies, and supplier constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interface with 3P Planning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Planning &amp;amp; Inventory Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align BOM changes with production schedules and implementation timing, ensuring operational feasibility before release.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Planning in managing packaging and label inventories, reducing obsolescence risks, and supporting decisions on stop orders and stock consumption strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Synchronization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure BOM changes are effectively integrated into production execution and monitor correct application in manufacturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier Interface &amp;amp; Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOM Deployment &amp;amp; Verification&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure suppliers receive updated BOMs through the Fusion Portal, acknowledge changes, and clearly understand implementation requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verify correct BOM versions and packaging materials are used during production and support issue resolution during changeovers and initial production runs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance, Compliance &amp;amp; Traceability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain full traceability for BOM creation, modifications, approvals, and implementation status.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure documented approvals, clear business justification for changes, and compliance with Fusion requirements and internal quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Experience required:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum exp. 3 to 5 with BOM Material&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Master Data Management, BOM Management, Supply Chain or Manufacturing Operations, ERP/Data Systems (SAP, Fusion, etc.), and structured process execution and coordination roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Systems Capability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail, data accuracy, and data governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of product line administration systems such as Fusion, Streamline, SAP, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to maintain data integrity, consistency, and traceability across systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process &amp;amp; Execution Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of BOM structures, change management processes, and supply chain interfaces (Planning, Procurement, Manufacturing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to ensure completeness, readiness, documentation discipline, proactive follow-up, and effective prioritization of multiple activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management, networking, and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively with geographically diverse teams and suppliers while driving alignment across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem Solving &amp;amp; Analytical Thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills with the ability to identify root causes, resolve operational and data-related issues, and support cross-functional solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change &amp;amp; Adaptability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to anticipate and manage change in a dynamic supply chain environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, adaptable, committed to continuous learning, and capable of supporting smooth implementation of changes across 3P plants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal English communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex information into clear, structured communication and ensure consistency in documentation and stakeholder interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(65, 145, 76);&quot;&gt;Privacy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;The Castrol entity recruiting for this role is the data controller for the personal information you provide. We use it to assess your application and to manage the recruitment and onboarding process. We may share it with service providers who support our recruitment, and it may be transferred to other Castrol entities internationally under appropriate safeguards. We keep it only for as long as necessary. For details of how we use your information and your data protection rights, contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;a id=&quot;OWAcac3778b-aec2-4e71-7765-87f7daa1b8b6&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot; href=&quot;mailto:privacy.response@castrol.com&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;privacy.response@castrol.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, marital status, socioeconomic status, neurodiversity/neurocognitive functioning, veteran status or disability status. Individuals with an accessibility need may request an adjustment/accommodation related to Castrol recruiting process (e.g., accessing the job application, completing required assessments, participating in telephone screenings or interviews, etc.).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are selected for a position and depending upon your role, your employment may be contingent upon adherence to local policy. This may include pre-placement drug screening, medical review of physical fitness for the role, and background checks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Castrol is one of the world’s leading lubricant brands, serving customers and consumers in the automotive, marine, industrial and energy sectors. Castrol brands are recognised globally for their premium quality and high performance, shaped by the company’s commitment to innovation and cutting-edge technology. With products sold in more than 150 countries, Castrol has helped keep things moving on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt; roads &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;and racetracks, air, sea, and space for over 125 years.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(101, 101, 101);&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;Whether you&#39;re just starting out or ready for your next big move, you&#39;re in the right place to explore an exciting career with Castrol.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(65, 145, 76);&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;Job description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;About the team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Global Marketing team is responsible for building the Castrol brand, driving growth and creating consistent, high-impact marketing across our markets and customer segments. The team works closely with Performance Unit marketing leaders, local markets, commercial teams, agencies and global functions to strengthen the Castrol Masterbrand and identify new sources of value.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This role sits on the Global Marketing Leadership Team, reports to the Global CMO and leads a global and diverse team with responsibility across masterbrand, sponsorships, adjacencies and marketing capability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Key tasks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead the global Castrol masterbrand strategy, including brand positioning, architecture, identity, social channels, websites and brand governance across markets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define and lead Castrol’s global sponsorship strategy, ensuring major partnerships are effectively activated and deliver measurable commercial and brand value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage a significant global sponsorship portfolio and work with markets to maximise the value of sponsorship rights, assets and investment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead the development of growth opportunities beyond the core lubricants business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Guide global marketing communications and agency activity, working closely with markets and the Marketing Hub to improve consistency, effectiveness and efficiency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Support marketing priorities associated with separation and post-Day 1 stabilisation, including TSA exits and transition workstreams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Define and develop the Marketing Capability framework, strengthening capability and career development across the global marketing community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Significant senior marketing leadership experience within a large, complex or multinational organisation, preferably FMCG, CPG, Automative.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong experience developing and governing brand strategy across multiple markets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience operating across consumer and B2B or B2B2C environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong commercial judgement, with experience using marketing effectiveness, ROI and investment data to make prioritisation decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience managing significant marketing investments, sponsorships, partnerships and global agency relationships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
